    "MacLock only: cached SDF/Snell fallback in the existing owner; bilinear per-channel samples from the same allowed preblurred scene, not the GLSL24-tap disk. Other CSS surfaces retain their prior fallback.",
    "MacLock original grain/tap rotation uses full-frame physical coordinates in the ES adapter, matching Qt gl_FragCoord conventions.",
    "Cover blurMax64 is not sigma64: a separately rendered native MultiEffect reference gives about24 CSS-pixel Gaussian-equivalent blur for the fixture; the brighter existing .84 multiplicative browser grade remains an explicit deviation from additive Qt brightness-.16."
